  "title": "Zucchini Pizza Bake",
  "description": "Bake this zucchini pizza in a casserole dish with a three-cheese zucchini crust, a meaty tomato sauce, fresh veggies, and mozzarella cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Christina"
  ],
